DOWNFALL-LOW_PROFILE.description:
Gain {CalculationBase:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold].
Gains {CalculationExtra:diff()} additional [gold]Block[/gold] for each of your Debuffs.{InCombat:
(Gains {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold].)|}

DOWNFALL-GRUDGE.description:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.
Deals {ExtraDamage:diff()} more for ALL your [gold]Curse[/gold] cards.{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-UNLEASH.description:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage.
Deals {ExtraDamage:diff()} more for each other card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-THE_TOWER.description:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.
