Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Add {IfUpgraded:show:an Upgraded |a }[gold]Shiv[/gold] to your [gold]Hand[/gold] for each card played this turn, until your [gold]Hand[/gold] is full.{InCombat:
({CalculatedCards:diff()} {CalculatedCards:plural:card|cards} played.)|}

